                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": 1
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per round</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The remacera has a creature @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Grabbed] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Restrained] in their jaws</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The creature takes @Damage[(2d10+8)[sonic]] damage with a @Check[fortitude|dc:24|basic|options:inflicts:stupefied] save. A creature that fails is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stupefied]{Stupefied 1} for 1 round (1 minute on a critical failure).</p>"
                },
